{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Forma 是一款協助規劃訓練、跟隨引導課表並追蹤訓練進度的 App，適合希望有系統安排運動的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-153.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>訓練計劃與進度追蹤</h2>\n<p>Forma 讓使用者規劃個人訓練內容，並跟隨引導式課表完成訓練；同時可追蹤訓練進度，整理每次練習安排。對於想有條理安排運動、掌握訓練狀況的人而言，清晰的計劃與追蹤流程有助按部就班完成練習，也更容易回顧自己的訓練安排。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-141-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-127-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-142-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-143-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-144-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Forma: Workout Routines</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/forma-workout-routines/id6810691516?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:47:39.908845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":256,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:34:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:43:12.852494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:41:11.239275+00:00","content_hash":"98e298b6b4bff4f0e47556203cae8a9ccbbddab811d1ad05107f6c02db5b3d6b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}